==Strategy==
Since both of the advent stages require similar types of units (anti-Aliens like [[Rover Cat (Rare Cat)|Catellite]] and rushers like [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train Cat]] and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]]), making a lineup centered around the previous stage will likely leave you with a lot of viable units for this one. However, you may also have to either reserve slots in your lineup for anti-Zombie units like [[Teacher BearCat (Rare Cat)|Cadaver BearCat]], or bring the Holy Blast Cannon which while helpful, has no use on the preceding stage.

==Trivia==
*Last of the Dead's Japanese name, Saigo no Shisha (最後の死者, lit. "The Final Dead Person"), sounds identical to the Japanese title of ''[[Neon Genesis Evangelion Collaboration Event|Neon Genesis Evangelion]]'' [https://wiki.evageeks.org/Episode_24 Episode 24]; the only difference is that unlike this stage's name, the episode title spells ''Shisha'' as シ者, allowing it to be interpreted as either "The Final Dead Person" or "The Final Messenger". This wordplay is used in [[Cruel Angel Clionel]]'s Japanese description as well.

